<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on the SMI.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on the SMI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 300,000 corridor warrants in three equal tranches on the SMI, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>There is one tranche of &quot;sidelines corridor' warrants, one tranche of &quot;bull corridor' warrants and one tranche of &quot;bear corridor' warrants.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   10.APR.97		 PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
